      "text": "Upon you … confer the Priesthood of Aaron, D&C 13 (27:8). called of God, and ordained an apostle, D&C 20:2. Peter, and James, and John … by whom I have ordained you, D&C 27:12. Holy Priesthood which he received under the hand of his father-in-law, Jethro, D&C 84:6. Lord confirmed a priesthood also upon Aaron, D&C 84:18. took Moses out of their midst … Holy Priesthood also, D&C 84:25. the lesser priesthood continued, D&C 84:26. priesthood hath continued through the lineage, D&C 86:8. This order was instituted in the days of Adam, D&C 107:41. Moses … committed unto us the keys of the gathering, D&C 110:11. Elias appeared, and committed the dispensation of the gospel of Abraham, D&C 110:12. keys of this dispensation are committed, D&C 110:16. the keys … have come down from the fathers, D&C 112:32. priesthood, which she, Zion, has a right to by lineage, D&C 113:8.",
